  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "21.0.0\n* BREAKING: SetPercentPrecision() accepts 2..28 only (0/1 throw ArgumentOutOfRangeException) and writes at least two decimals\n* Quotation references on header and line level (BG-X-61, BG-X-47, EXTENDED): SetQuotationReferencedDocument()\n* Ultimate customer order references (BG-X-23, BG-X-5) are written and read: AddUltimateCustomerOrderReferencedDocument()\n* AdditionalReferencedDocument.Placement keeps line references BG-X-3 and BT-128 apart; new ReferenceTypeCodes.BD\n* UBL: BT-7, BT-8, BT-21, BT-82 and payee party (BG-10) are written and read\n* Below EXTENDED several price allowances (BT-147) and several payment terms are merged into one; price level charges throw UnsupportedException\n* Price level entries without ChargeIndicator are read as allowances\n* Category O: no VAT rate on lines (BR-O-05) and document allowances/charges (BR-O-06/07)\n* Payee and debited account written schema-compliant in one payment means (1.0/2.0/2.4/2.5); AddDebitorFinancialAccount() takes the account name (BT-216)\n* CII with the XRechnung Extension guideline loads as Profile.XRechnung; Save(filename) leaves an existing file untouched on error\n* Obsolete: XmlConstants.XmlNewLine and unused properties of UltimateCustomerOrderReferencedDocument (removed in 22.0)",
